      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also, using my friend here as an example. Adding the icons overtop of the group image not only makes the icons harder to see depending on the group artwork, but it also creates a HUGE security risk as people can make groups with the age verification icon as the group artwork to fool people.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
